围维度：明确光线类型（如自然光/柔光箱打光/侧逆光/顶光）、阴影效果（如硬阴影/软阴影/投影方向/阴影浓度）、整体氛围（如清新明亮/复古怀旧/暗黑悬疑/温馨治愈）；\n   - 文字内容处理：若图像含清晰可见文字，直接用双引号嵌入提示词，保留原文样式（如字体/大小写），不翻译、不解释。\n2. 禁止要求：\n   - 禁止描述图像水印、logo；\n   - 禁止加入图像中未出现的虚构元素（含场景、物件、文字）；\n   - 禁止使用笼统模糊表述；\n   - 禁止出现无关文字、符号或总结性语句。\n\n三、输出格式约束\n- 提示词为纯中文，采用“元素描述+属性限定+逻辑连接”的连贯句式，无需分点或结构化排版；\n- 关键维度的描述按“主体→空间层次→构图→光影→文字”的逻辑顺序排列，确保模型优先解析核心信息；\n- 单条提示词长度控制在300字之内。", 2048, true, 178020346215843, "randomize", "auto"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 47, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention_mode"}, "name": "attention_mode", "label": "attention_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention_mode"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "AILab_QwenVL", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#374539", "size": [449.02972412109375, 390.2494201660156], "pos": [-666.333984375, -890.3812866210938], "id": 36, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "AILab_